flowchart TD
    A[M11 page diagnostics] --> B{Page type is Scanned?}
    B -- No --> C[Keep native extraction path]
    B -- Yes --> D{Within candidate-page limit?}
    D -- No --> E[Record SkippedLimit]
    D -- Yes --> F[Calculate pixel-safe render plan]
    F --> G[Render page locally with PDFium]
    G --> H[Recognize ron + eng with Tesseract]
    H --> I{Usable recognized text?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Record Ready and use OCR section]
    I -- No --> K[Record Empty or Failed]
    C --> L[Merge pages in original order]
    E --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M[Persist raw section provenance and OCR diagnostics]

